'''Splitter''' is a [[Vintage Weapons|vintage]] knife originally purchasable from the shop in [[Murder Mystery|Murder Mystery 1]] for 800 Points {{Currency|Point}} or 5 Cash {{Currency|Cash}}. It can now only be obtained through trading.
== Appearance ==
Splitter has a dagger shape pattern. Its blade is like a spearhead being grey while its guard is golden. The handle is bright red and white.
== Trivia ==
*It used to include a description of "Makes your knife look cooler." upon purchase.
*Its model originated from the Roblox item [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/22787189/Crimson-Double-Threat Crimson Double Threat].
*This is currently the third smallest [[Knives|knife]] in the game.
*Splitter  is one of the ten weapons in the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Vintage Set|Vintage Set]], the others being: [[Shadow]], [[Phaser]], [[Golden]], [[America (Vintage)|America]], [[Blood]], [[Laser (Vintage)|Laser]], [[Prince]], and [[Cowboy]]

